      "content": "everything is just way too much lately. the lights are too bright, people are too loud, even my own thoughts feel like they're screaming. i just feel like i'm constantly vibrating with this anxiety and i can't turn it off. i just want it to be quiet. like, actually, completely quiet. i just need the noise to stop.",
