    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried the headphones but it doesnt work. it's like the noise is inside my head. even when everything is dark it's still so loud in there. it feels like there's no way to actually get any relief from it. it's just constant. i feel so tired of trying to fight it. i just want a way to make it all just... stop. permanently.",
