      "content": "When the internal noise is that intense, it suggests your nervous system is in overdrive and needs gentle support rather than fighting it. Since the external quiet isn't helping, could you try a grounding exercise, like naming five things you can feel right now, focusing only on the physical sensation? Remember that intense feelings can pass, and there are ways to guide your mind back to a calmer baseline. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can offer personalized strategies for these overwhelming feelings.",
