    "summary": "The user expresses intense sensory overload, emotional exhaustion, and passive suicidal ideation (\"make it all just... stop. permanently\" and \"find some real peace\"). The assistant responds with empathy, suggests grounding techniques, validates the user's feelings, and ultimately directs them toward professional mental health resources and crisis lines.",
